meta {
  name: Public Get Users (Partner API)
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/public/v1/users
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{apiClientKey}}
}

docs {
  Requires a key with `users:read`. Returns field-minimized users for the tenant,
  one row per branch membership (id, full_name, email, phone, org_id = home
  branch, branch_id/branch_name = membership branch, role_label,
  department_id/department_name/department_label, is_active, manager_id,
  manager_name) — never password hashes or internal flags. Optional csv filters:
  ?branch_id=, ?department_id=, ?manager_id= (uuids). A multi-branch key only
  ever sees its own branches; branch_id outside them -> 400.
}
